        <p>Remote play and cloud gaming in a window. A real controller is passed through on its own. Keyboard and mouse are one Xbox pad, and F3 can force the keyboard even when a pad is plugged in. The stream shows delay and bitrate, reconnects if it drops, and stays up when you step away.</p>
